{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become immersed in this 100% accurate <strong>first-person simulation</strong> of the modern man\u2019s life in Man Simulator 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be man enough to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/b0819b165bacb94b664ef54b224d390c.avif?t=1767912307\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>distinct vape flavors</strong> from Mango Mix to Vanilla Milkshake. Utilize each vape's unique power up and feel the heady of your dreams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/0b9f8c74dc099d991f1e9ea420edacce.poster.avif?t=1767912307\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/0b9f8c74dc099d991f1e9ea420edacce.webm?t=1767912307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/0b9f8c74dc099d991f1e9ea420edacce.mp4?t=1767912307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/2876412a064b196acbc163f340366634.avif?t=1767912307\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a <strong>state of the art sports betting simulation</strong>. Feel like the characters of your favorite baseball film while discovering trends by utilizing<strong> Advanced Sports Statistics</strong>. Use this information to <strong>hit your parlay</strong> and watch the money rain down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/d0e51e513e9845a732adc4e362d338d2.poster.avif?t=1767912307\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/d0e51e513e9845a732adc4e362d338d2.webm?t=1767912307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/d0e51e513e9845a732adc4e362d338d2.mp4?t=1767912307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/ce41d47c47bbd2f608553e63cd96fd4e.avif?t=1767912307\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live exclusively off food delivered to your home in a brown paper bag. Burgers, fries, and soda will keep you in great health, providing various multipliers to your payouts. No water is needed when you can drink <strong>SODA.</strong>\u00a0Clean up your MANspace by<strong> draining buckets into the waste bin</strong>\u00a0and earning some extra cash while doing so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/ae982413ae446f7155c2bf3e390a5a89.poster.avif?t=1767912307\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/ae982413ae446f7155c2bf3e390a5a89.webm?t=1767912307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/ae982413ae446f7155c2bf3e390a5a89.mp4?t=1767912307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama